My Recommendation

Don’t rewrite everything at once. Do it in 3 phases:

Phase 1 — Add the Evaluator + Repair nodes inside your existing sequential flow. This alone fixes your core accuracy issue (zero relevance scoring) without touching the routing.

Phase 2 — Add the StreamClassifier routing split (light path vs anomaly path). This reduces cost and latency on clean log batches immediately.

Phase 3 — Add checkpointing + Autopilot interrupt gate. This makes the product safe for production team onboarding.

Each phase is independently deployable. Phase 1 is maybe 2 days of work — start there.
